1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,433
Rule four. A cough counts as speaking.
Breathe through your nose.

2
00:00:04,933 --> 00:00:08,767
My throat is already tight. I use one
puff by the window. One left.

3
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:11,867
Out for four. In for two. Dad's count.
Do it with me.

4
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:15,867
Out for four. In for two. It works
better when she says it.
